---
title: Rosy Italian Dressing
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Sauces & Dressings
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@tomato juice{1%c}
@cornstarch{1%tsp}
@mixed Italian herbs{1/4%tsp}
@salad oil{1%Tbsp}
@onion salt{2%tsp}
@vinegar{1/4%c}

Combine tomato juice, cornstarch and onion salt in small saucepan. Cook over moderate heat, stirring, until mixture boils and thickens slightly. Remove from heat and cool.
